# C1/C2 supervised baselines: 132 per-task checkpoints (~900 MB, seeds 0-5) plus their histories. Same
# status as experiments/**/models/ above; anchored to this one experiment rather than adding another
# unanchored `runs/` pattern. The committed record is experiments/c1c2_supervised_README.md.
experiments/c1c2_supervised/runs/

# Generated tabular outputs (result tables, caches, profiles). Numbers live in W&B, the experiment
# READMEs and docs/STATUS.md; the CSV/parquet themselves are regenerable from the analysis scripts.
*.csv
*.parquet
# LaTeX build artefacts of the paper. Anchored to /paper/ rather than a repo-wide `*.aux`: these
# regenerate on every latexmk run, and the compiled main.pdf is committed deliberately as the
# collaborator-facing draft.
/paper/*.aux
/paper/*.bbl
/paper/*.blg
/paper/*.out
/paper/*.fdb_latexmk
/paper/*.fls
/paper/*.synctex.gz

